        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Guangh pyrun 4^& Pou khou runlou tho!",
            "Guangh Khrista ta meickin guay thuanc diu!",
            "Kazanc aniu chakhwang champouh ni,",
            "’Taw nic tingsaengzaengna.",
            "Guangh pyrun .. 4^& ’niw runlou ni;",
            "Hymdaih dic thangc Kakhou runlou ni,",
            "Thuanc .. ni, Guangh ta thuanc .. ni,",
            "Thuanhpui khwan kauc ranv ni!",
            "",
            "2 Thuanc o, Pou ta kauh baanch’ra guay lev,",
            "Kabamvpaeng hu khou nrah zay o;",
            "He zaatc guayle, neihlaana kauc o;",
            "Guangh guay Guangc ta thuanc o!”",
            "",
            "3 Paapc ric ngammei Kaipouc Kamei e,",
            "KaBumaengc @<4 ’niw lung hei sin diu;",
            "Kazanc paan @<4 aniu rih ngam ni;",
            "Tingsaeng khang runlou o."
          ]
        }
      },
